{"book":"jeremiah","lang":"en","model":"glm-5.2","timestamp":"2026-07-23T11:51:27.875030613Z","verse":20,"ref":"jeremiah 15:20","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":15,"translation":"And I will appoint you to this people ⟨as⟩ a wall of bronze, fortified, and they will fight against you, but they will not be able ⟨to prevail⟩ against you; for I ⟨am⟩ with ⟨את⟩ you, to deliver you and to rescue you — ⟨is⟩ the utterance of YHWH.","tokens":[{"surface":"ונתתיך","gloss":"And I will appoint you"},{"surface":"לעם","gloss":"to this people"},{"surface":"הזה","gloss":"this"},{"surface":"לחומת","gloss":"⟨as⟩ a wall"},{"surface":"נחשת","gloss":"of bronze"},{"surface":"בצורה","gloss":"fortified"},{"surface":"ונלחמו","gloss":"and they will fight"},{"surface":"אליך","gloss":"against you"},{"surface":"ולא","gloss":"but not"},{"surface":"יוכלו","gloss":"will they be able"},{"surface":"לך","gloss":"against you"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"for"},{"surface":"אתך","gloss":"with ⟨את⟩ you"},{"surface":"אני","gloss":"I"},{"surface":"להושיעך","gloss":"to save you"},{"surface":"ולהצילך","gloss":"and to deliver you"},{"surface":"נאם","gloss":"utterance of"},{"surface":"יהוה","gloss":"YHWH"}]}